'''Ice deserts''' are a removed snow-covered [[biome]], which existed prior to the [[Adventure Update]]. The biome consisted of large [[sand]] flats, with a snow layer cover.

== Description ==
Ice deserts are similar in appearance to [[tundra]]s, with fairly flat land and small hills. However, instead of [[Grass Block|grass]], the surface is primarily made up of sand. Flowers and trees do not generate in this biome, and passive mobs do not spawn in it. The ice desert biome was supposed to generate around tundras, however, it does not get selected by the function which maps temperature and rainfall to biomes.

